{"ClientPermissionsV2.getClientsWithPermission() returns Resource.name values for resources of type 'Clients', which includes the schema's all-clients resource named 'Clients' and excludes per-client resources because getOrCreateResource() never sets a type on those resources. When a caller treats returned values as client UUIDs, a granted 'all-clients' permission yields cid='Clients' and causes a NullPointerException": 0.6622945070266724, "MgmtPermissionsV2 now returns ClientPermissionsV2, but ClientPermissionsV2 throws UnsupportedOperationException for permission-management methods like setPermissionsEnabled/isPermissionsEnabled/resource/getPermissions. If both ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ and ADMIN_FINE_GRAINED_AUTHZ_V2 are enabled, V1-gated endpoints/listeners still call AdminPermissions.management(...).clients().setPermissionsEnabled/isPermissionsEnabled and will crash at runtime": 0.8589468598365784}